    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Form an equation and solve.\n\nWhen 14 is added to half of Suzette’s weight in kilograms, the result is 42. How much does Suzette weigh?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$56\\text{ kg}$",
      "worked": "Let $w$ be Suzette’s weight in kilograms.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{w}{2}+14&=42\\\\\\frac{w}{2}&=28\\\\w&=56\\end{align*}$$\n\nSuzette weighs $56\\text{ kg}$.",
